(
    title: "Fast Eddie",
    developer: Some("Mark Turmell (Sirius Software)"),
    description: Some("Eddie sprints and leaps through a four-storey building of ladders and platforms, grabbing prizes while the marching Sneakers patrol every floor. Nine prizes arm the finale: vault the giant High-Top guarding the top floor to take the last one and start over faster. Eight variations tune the chase — an early credit from Mark Turmell, who went on to make NBA Jam."),
